// to everyone, like the about read: a signed-out visitor reads docs. A page is answered only when the repository's own
// index lists its path, so a request never names what ChatApi fetches (worker/docs/Source.ts). ChatApi routes these
// before RepoApi's reads (worker/ChatApiProgram.ts).
